# SPA client-route fallback (Cloudflare Pages).
#
# IMPORTANT: Cloudflare Pages _redirects does NOT support 404 rewrites
# (only 200 proxy + 3xx). A rule like `/static/* /asset-missing.txt 404` is
# ignored. A catch-all `/* /index.html 200` then serves HTML for missing JS
# chunks, and `_headers` can immutable-cache that HTML as if it were JS.
# That poisons /static/* after deploy races and loops route loads forever.
#
# Fix: list SPA routes explicitly. Never rewrite /static/* or /assets/*.
# Existing files still win over these rules. Missing hashed chunks 404.

# Single-segment app routes (with and without trailing slash).
# Some edge configs 308 bare paths to /; explicit pairs keep mobile + SEO deep links alive.
